WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.200
The kitchen floor is
damaged. Can you tile it?

2
00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:11.160
Hello, I'm Nina, the tiler. I'll remove
the old tiles, and I'll lay new ones.

3
00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:13.480
Are the tiles from France?

4
00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:20.500
Yes. They're terracotta tiles, made in the
region. The floor will be ready on Friday.
